# Copy to .env for local development. .env is gitignored; this file is not.
#
# Web3Forms access key, created at https://web3forms.com against the inbox
# that should receive referrals (info@rapidlinkmed.com). The destination
# address is bound to the key on Web3Forms' side, not set in this repo, so
# changing where submissions land means issuing a new key rather than editing
# code.
#
# This value is not a secret. Vite inlines every VITE_-prefixed variable into
# the client bundle, so the key is readable in the deployed page source. That
# is how Web3Forms is designed to work: the key can only submit to the form,
# it cannot read past submissions or change the destination.
#
# Because the value is inlined at build time, setting it on the host is not
# enough on its own. Redeploy after adding or changing it.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
